===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|inh|enm>carre>cart|id=wheeled vehicle}}
{{inh+|en|enm|carre}}, borrowed from {{der|en|xno|carre}}, from {{der|en|fro-nor|-}} (compare {{cog|fro|char}}), from {{der|en|la|carrus||two-wheeled baggage wagon}}, from {{der|en|cel-gau|*karros}}, from {{der|en|cel-pro|*karros||wagon}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ḱr̥sós||vehicle}}. {{dbt|en|horse}}.

